{title: Bewafa}
{artist: Imran Khan}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] Gal Sun Mere tu mutiyare,        [D] Ki samjhe apne aap nu?
[C] Mere magaro tu Ki ki kardi,        [D] Ae gal bus tu hi jandi
[Em] Menu sufayan pesh na [Bm] kar,        Rab kolo thora jeha [C] darr
Sikh ja ke [D] pyar karne de [Bm] val,        Jhoote sang [C] sade ik ik [Em] pal
Be [Bm] wafaaaa bewafaaa,        Bew [D] afa nikli hai [Em] tu
Ni jhootha [Bm] pyar jhootha pyar,        Jhoota [D] pyar kita hai [Em] tu
[Em] Jado nere mere kol tu hove,        [D] Yaadaan vichh door tu khove
[C] Sanu sadni ae naa oda leke,        [D] Tenu pende ode phuleke
[Em] Menu kuch kendi na hun [Bm] lor,        Mera dil torke tu na hor [C] tor
PYaar tere [D] chaida na [Bm] ho,        Saade pyar di [C] nishani aj tu [Em] mor
Be [Bm] wafaaaa bewafaaa,        Bew [D] afa nikli hai [Em] tu
Ni jhootha [Bm] pyar jhootha pyar,        Jhoota [D] pyar kita hai [Em] tu
[Em] Mere zindagi'ch kyu tu ayi?        Yaari [Bm] kyu ni tu nibhayi?
Kiti [C] sadi naal bewafay,        Sanu [Am] de kuriyee jawaab?
Dus de [C] keri gul [D] di,        Sanu [Bm] deriyee [Em] sazaaaa?
Rowe gi menu [D] yaad karke,        [D] Rowe gi menu [Bm] yaad [Em] karke
Be [Bm] wafaaaa bewafaaa,        Bew [D] afa nikli hai [Em] tu
Ni jhootha [Bm] pyar jhootha pyar,        Jhoota [D] pyar kita hai [Em] tu
